id: 12F-011
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Hardcoded port binding (12-Factor VII: Port binding)
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .py .java .go .rs .rb
  exclude_paths: test/ spec/ __tests__/ vendor/ node_modules/ _test.go mock
patterns:
  - regex: \.listen\((3000|8080|8000|8888|4000|5000|9000|80|443)\b
    message: Hardcoded port in listen() — read from PORT env variable
  - regex: :(3000|8080|8000|8888|4000|5000|9000)"\)
    message: Hardcoded port in address string — read from PORT env variable
fix: Read the port from process.env.PORT / os.Getenv("PORT") (12-Factor VII)
